msgid "## Inference {: #quick-start-inference }"
msgstr "## 推理 {: #quick-start-inference }"

msgid "??? tip \"If Hugging Face access is restricted\""
msgstr "??? tip \"如果Hugging Face访问受限\""

msgid ""
"If your environment cannot reliably access Hugging Face, model downloads may"
" fail due to connection timeouts, DNS errors, or other network issues. You "
"can switch to ModelScope:"
msgstr ""
"如果您的环境无法稳定访问Hugging Face，模型下载可能会因连接超时、DNS错误或其他网络问题而失败。您可以切换到ModelScope："

msgid ""
"If the model has already been downloaded locally, replace the model ID in "
"the examples below with the local directory. You do not need to set this "
"environment variable."
msgstr "如果模型已下载到本地，请将以下示例中的模型ID替换为本地目录。您无需设置此环境变量。"

msgid "### Offline inference {: #quick-start-offline-inference }"
msgstr "### 离线推理 {: #quick-start-offline-inference }"

msgid "### Online serving {: #quick-start-online-serving }"
msgstr "### 在线服务 {: #quick-start-online-serving }"

msgid "## Next steps {: #quick-start-next-steps }"
msgstr "## 后续步骤 {: #quick-start-next-steps }"

msgid ""
"- See [Supported Models](../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md) to choose another model.\n"
"- See [Model Tutorials](../tutorials/models/index.md) for deployment instructions for specific models.\n"
"- See [Installation Guide > Set up the software environment](installation.md#installation-software-environment) for pip, CANN, and source installation methods.\n"
"- See [Feature Tutorials](../tutorials/features/index.md) for distributed deployment and advanced features.\n"
"- See [FAQ](../faqs.md) to troubleshoot common deployment issues."
msgstr ""
"- 请参阅[支持的模型](../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md)选择其他模型。\n"
"- 请参阅[模型教程](../tutorials/models/index.md)了解特定模型的部署说明。\n"
"- 请参阅[安装指南 > 设置软件环境](installation.md#installation-software-environment)了解pip、CANN和源码安装方法。\n"
"- 请参阅[功能教程](../tutorials/features/index.md)了解分布式部署和高级功能。\n"
"- 请参阅[FAQ](../faqs.md)排查常见的部署问题。"

msgid ""
"The prebuilt image includes a validated Python and Ascend user-space "
"software stack, including CANN, NNAL, PyTorch, TorchNPU, vLLM, and vLLM "
"Ascend."
msgstr ""
"预构建镜像包含经过验证的Python和昇腾用户态软件栈，其中包括CANN、NNAL、PyTorch、TorchNPU、vLLM和vLLM Ascend。"

msgid ""
"For the exact validated versions, see [Installation Guide > Hardware and "
"software stack](installation.md#installation-hardware-software-stack)."
msgstr ""
"有关经过验证的确切版本，请参见[安装指南 > 硬件和软件栈](installation.md#installation-hardware-"
"software-stack)。"

msgid "??? note \"Software stack included in the vLLM Ascend image\""
msgstr "??? note \"vLLM Ascend镜像中包含的软件栈\""

msgid ""
"A2, A3, and 950DT images also include the matching Triton Ascend runtime. "
"Atlas 300I DUO and Atlas 200I Pro do not use Triton Ascend."
msgstr ""
"A2、A3和950DT镜像还包含配套的Triton Ascend运行时。Atlas 300I DUO和Atlas 200I Pro不使用Triton "
"Ascend。"

msgid ""
"This guide uses Qwen3-0.6B as an example to help you run your first offline "
"inference workload or deploy an online service on a prepared Ascend host "
"using a prebuilt vLLM Ascend container."
msgstr "本指南以Qwen3-0.6B为例，帮助您在已准备好的昇腾主机上使用预构建的vLLM Ascend容器运行首个离线推理任务或部署在线服务。"

msgid ""
"Before using containers, make sure Docker is installed on your system. If "
"Docker is not installed, please refer to the [Docker installation "
"guide](https://docs.docker.com/get-started/get-docker/) for installation "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"使用容器前，请确保系统已安装Docker。如果尚未安装，请参阅[Docker安装指南](https://docs.docker.com/get-"
"started/get-docker/)获取安装说明。"

